The '''secret Phoenix Cell route''' was a secret [[hyperspace route]] created by the [[RA-7 protocol droid]] [[AP-5]] when using both the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[databank]] and the data obtained by [[Phoenix Cell]] to reach [[Atollon]]. The [[hyperspace]] route became a closely guarded secret and the rebels established [[Chopper Base]] on Atollon's surface.<ref name="Dawn" />

